### Performance Governance

**Service Level Objectives (SLOs) per Partition**:

| Metric | Target (per partition) | Measurement | Consequences of Miss |
|--------|------------------------|-------------|----------------------|
| Query Latency (P95) | <500ms | Per partition, sampled every 5 min | Warning alert at 800ms, critical alert at 1500ms |
| Query Latency (P99) | <1500ms | Per partition | State account manager notified |
| Write Throughput | >1000 TPS | Per partition | Autoscaling triggered at 800 TPS |
| Partition Availability | 99.95% | Per partition, measured monthly | Financial penalty if <99.9% (per state contract) |
| Replication Lag | <2 seconds | Primary → replica | Read queries routed to primary if lag >5s |
| Connection Pool Utilization | <80% | Per partition | Alert at 85%, scale connection pool at 90% |

**SLO Monitoring Dashboard** (Grafana):

```yaml
